# Everything not listed here is uploaded to Fly's builder when you deploy. The build only
# needs OneADay/ and deploy/, so leave the rest behind.

# Never upload: the live data. App_Data holds the question bank, subscriber addresses and
# encryption keys; it reaches the server through its own step, never the image (PRD 10).
OneADay/App_Data/

